## Develop

```sh
appsctl validate .{{if .WithUI}}
ndpreview serve .          # preview ui.json at Kobo size on 127.0.0.1{{end}}
```

Copy the folder to `/mnt/onboard/.adds/apps/{{.ID}}/` (or run `tools/install-to-kobo.sh` from the NickelDrawer repo) and tap **Apps · Refresh list**.

## What it touches

Declare this in `app.json` so reviews and `appsctl validate` can hold the code to it:

- **Network:** `"network": false` today. Set `true` if the app talks to the network.
- **Shared folders:** none today. Add `"storage": {"reads": ["pictures"], "writes": ["inbox"]}` with the logical names listed in `docs/spec/app-format.md` when the app reads or writes outside its own `data/` folder.
- Its own `data/` folder needs no declaration. Never ship `data/` in a package.

## Translate

English lives in `app.json` and `locales/en.json`. Copy `locales/vi.json` to `locales/<lang>.json` and translate it; keep the `{placeholders}` unchanged.
